---
import mascot from '../assets/toby-mascot.png';
---

<section class="section story" id="about">
  <div class="container story__inner">
    <div class="story__text">
      <p class="eyebrow">Hi, I'm David</p>
      <h2>The guy behind EffortlessFlow</h2>
      <p>
        EffortlessFlow is a tiny software team — currently just me — building
        simple, focused apps for everyday problems.
      </p>
      <p>
        You know all those little things that make life harder than it needs to
        be? The wishlist scattered across three apps. The downloads folder you
        stopped opening. The thing you quietly gave up and learned to tolerate.
        Most of what I build starts right there — with an annoying thing I
        noticed, and the thought <em>surely there's a better way</em>.
      </p>
      <p>
        The plan is software that helps without becoming yet another thing to
        manage. No accounts you didn't ask for, no features you have to learn —
        just enough to work, and work well. And I'm building it all in the
        open, one specific problem at a time.
      </p>
      <blockquote class="story__mantra">
        Just enough to work, and work well.
      </blockquote>
    </div>
    <aside class="story__card" aria-hidden="true">
      <img src={mascot} width={120} height={99} alt="" />
      <p class="story__card-note">
        growth, one small wish at a time — toby's little mascot
      </p>
    </aside>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .story__inner {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) 15rem;
    gap: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 4.5rem);
    align-items: start;
  }

  .story__text {
    max-width: 40rem;
  }

  .story__mantra {
    margin: 2.25rem 0 0;
    padding: 1.4rem 1.75rem;
    border-left: 4px solid var(--ef-orange);
    border-radius: 0 var(--radius-card) var(--radius-card) 0;
    background: var(--ef-forest-wash);
    font-size: 1.3rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: var(--ef-forest);
  }

  .story__card {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.9rem;
    padding: 2rem 1.5rem;
    border: 1.5px solid var(--ef-line);
    border-radius: var(--radius-card);
    background: #fff;
    rotate: 1.5deg;
    margin-top: 3.4rem;
  }

  .story__card img {
    width: 118px;
  }

  .story__card-note {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: var(--fs-small);
    line-height: 1.55;
    text-align: center;
    color: var(--ef-ink-soft);
  }

  @media (max-width: 860px) {
    .story__inner {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .story__card {
      margin-top: 0;
      width: fit-content;
    }
  }
</style>
